<title>USA: Aerial Communications Inc Q1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Aerial Communications Inc Q1 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $0.31     loss	 $0.11</p>
<p> Net	 loss	  22,340     loss	 6,671</p>
<p> Revs			    NA			 NA</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  71,384		   59,086</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: No revenues were reported. The company launched first commercial market in Columbus, Ohio, on March 27. It intends to launch service in five remaining trading areas during the second quarter.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 development costs $5.1 million vs $2.0 million.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
